      "description": "Ballina Station. The terminus of the branch line from Manulla Junction. The Ballina line is part of the InterCity network but is usually operated by a 'suburban' class 2800 diesel multiple unit, as seen here, which provides a connecting shuttle service at Manulla Junction with InterCity trains running between Westport and Dublin Hueston. Ballina still retains rail freight facilities and has regular container and timber traffic.",
